<br><br>As a casual game, it is designed to take about an hour per play.<br><br>A good way to play might be to aim for first place in the nation in the time attack ranking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Story -</h2>What awaits you inside the mysterious structure that towers over a corner of the universe?<br>The story begins when you touch a glowing body drifting on the surface of the earth.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667160/extras/3707dbf3bfc6fd595c0a16e5edfaeda1.avif?t=1743418298\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Operation -</h2>You can use the mouse wheel QE 12345 to switch weapons.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667160/extras/fb72397085cab54516b542988aad43d7.poster.avif?t=1743418298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667160/extras/fb72397085cab54516b542988aad43d7.webm?t=1743418298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667160/extras/fb72397085cab54516b542988aad43d7.mp4?t=1743418298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
